<title>FRANCE: LYONNAISE TO ISSUE SUEZ STATEMENT APRIL 11.</title>
<headline>LYONNAISE TO ISSUE SUEZ STATEMENT APRIL 11.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French utilities group Lyonnaise des Eaux said it planned to issue a statement on April 11 after a special board meeting to discuss a proposed merger with holding company Cie de Suez .</p>
<p>Lyonnaise des Eaux also expects to hold an analysts' meeting on Monday April 14, starting at 0600 GMT.</p>
</text>
